    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d66">

                <pb facs="0336" n="50" xml:id="pg50"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 763.72/2844a</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        Minister in Roumania</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Vopicka</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1916-09-06T16:00:00-05:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">September 6, 1916, 4 p. m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>304. Has war against Roumania been declared by Germany and Bulgaria or <hi
                        rendition="#italic">vice versa</hi>? Cable.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
